	<entry name="Orks/TankbustaBombFlavor" value="<string name='Weapons/TankbustaBombFlavor'/>"/>

	<entry name="Orks/Kommando" value="Kommandos"/>
	<entry name="Orks/KommandoDescription" value="Alpha-strike infiltrator unit that excels in forests or Imperial ruins and can deliver a powerful alpha strike."/>
	<entry name="Orks/KommandoFlavor" value="Where most Orks love getting stuck in with a minimum of muckin’ about, Kommandos take the average Ork’s low cunning to the extreme. Rather than run at an enemy yelling, they would rather sneak up and stick a dagger through their victim’s ribs. Their greatest satisfaction is the thump of exploding ammo dumps or the screams of enemies as stikkbombs clatter into their barracks. Other Orks grumble, calling it ‘un-Orky’, but can’t deny its effectiveness."/>

