	<entry name="AdeptusMechanicus/Monastery" value="Monastery of the Omnissiah’s Lightning"/>
	<entry name="AdeptusMechanicus/MonasteryDescription" value="Building that produces a lot of Energy and can also produce Electropriests. <br/><br/> Requires 3 build slots and 3 population to operate."/>
	<entry name="AdeptusMechanicus/MonasteryFlavor" value="Within these sanctified halls, flesh is rendered unto the Omnissiah and repaid in lightning. Each prayer is a circuit, each scar a sacrament, and through suffering the Sacred Current flows eternal."/>



